{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Santa to find his missing reindeer and prepare for Christmas! Jingles the Jule Duck guides you on this hidden object adventure, where you have to collect an abundance of Christmas items, decorations and find delicious foods, which are hidden in the most detailed and intricate environments in full 3D.\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030650/extras/3deeecab0cf6708451857c5e6f8b1607.poster.avif?t=1761381960\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030650/extras/3deeecab0cf6708451857c5e6f8b1607.webm?t=1761381960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030650/extras/3deeecab0cf6708451857c5e6f8b1607.mp4?t=1761381960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the keys, pull the right levers to locked doors and open containers to discover the hidden objects in each detailed and colorful level, each featuring an extensive playlist of cozy Christmas music.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030650/extras/b22900a611b4686a4739bdc00e1496be.poster.avif?t=1761381960\" width=616 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030650/extras/b22900a611b4686a4739bdc00e1496be.webm?t=1761381960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030650/extras/b22900a611b4686a4739bdc00e1496be.mp4?t=1761381960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore Santa's Home or take a ride on his express train straight to the holiday museum! Each level offer lots of varieties and varied items to be found, from international Christmas treats to ugly sweaters and specific holiday decorations.<br>  <br>Collect lots of additional eatable items, dust off the spiderwebs and sweep away the dirt; if you wish to obtain a perfect score.  <br>  <br>The spirit of Christmas awaits! Happy Holidays!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030650/extras/4960d270cdfe1543f0a4de9122c5bd44.poster.avif?t=1761381960\" width=616 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030650/extras/4960d270cdfe1543f0a4de9122c5bd44.webm?t=1761381960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030650/extras/4960d270cdfe1543f0a4de9122c5bd44.mp4?t=1761381960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 large exciting and varied levels to explore! (6-10+ hours of gametime)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple Point &amp; Click controls in detailed 3D environments. Use mouse and/or Keyboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect 100+ Varied and unique quest items and collectibles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find 1000+ various eatables and sweep, dirt, spiderweb and trash as an optional challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and enjoy the wonderful Christmas themed atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A curious riddle based hint system based on gingerbread currency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and learn different Christmas culture references when inspecting each item.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive and cozy (Non-vocal) Christmas music playlists.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://st