agraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 large exciting and varied levels to explore! (6-10+ hours of gametime)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple Point &amp; Click controls in detailed 3D environments. Use mouse and/or Keyboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect 100+ Varied and unique quest items and collectibles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find 1000+ various eatables and sweep, dirt, spiderweb and trash as an optional challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and enjoy the wonderful Christmas themed atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A curious riddle based hint system based on gingerbread currency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and learn different Christmas culture references when inspecting each item.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive and cozy (Non-vocal) Christmas music playlists.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Shapeshift Entertainment ApS"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030650/af4eb7a91b4055dfa6bbe65b2cd9087325e402a8/header.jpg?t=1761381960","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Copyright Shapeshift Entertainment ApS","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3030650/1900389145/6b4e6b27b3304291cbad575de2df9045c535243a/1756305242/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756306992","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3030650/1900389145/6b4e6b27b3304291cbad575de2df9045c535243a/1756305242/da